WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Brought to you by Bayi Subs

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.580
Oy! Stop running!

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:42.820
Stop!

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.280
Get back here!

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:46.680
Explain yourself!

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:04.220
This accursed day...

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:05.740
Is finally over...

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:07.740
But dying so spectacularly...

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:09.800
Isn't like me at all...

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:19.140
Hey, youngster.

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:20.480
Answer me quick. ~

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:23.260
You ate Cupid's Chocolates, didn't you?

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:40.120
