Director: Xiong Ke

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:06.400
My name is Jiang Haoyi.

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:07.880
I'm 19 years old.

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:10.920
I'm a normal first year university student.

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:14.140
My university life is very simple.

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:15.600
Extracurriculars...

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:17.040
Scholarships...

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.040
None of these things have anything to do with me.

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:20.720
I like how things are,

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.720
Leading this bland, placid life of mine.

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:26.060
No one ever notices me.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.060
Peaceful and free...

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.620
If I could live my whole life like this...

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:32.620
Well, it wouldn't be too bad.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:46.680
Students...

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:48.660
Please take out your textbooks.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:51.820
It's the school beauty, Xia Zitong!

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:53.820
Why is she here in our classroom??

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.980
Ohhh man, look at that body!

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:58.980
She's literally the girl of my dreams!

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.360
No way...

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:07.420
She came here looking for me?

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:09.620
Hold on...

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.620
What's with her flustered expression?

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:14.480
Um...

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.480
Jiang Haoyi...

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:19.740
I'm pregnant with your baby!

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:29.180
Wait, WHAT!?

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:31.180
Aw hell no! Our Goddess has been tainted by a pig!

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:32.460
Expose him!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:34.460
Jiang Haoyi! This is a severe violation of school policy!

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:36.460
Vile bastard!

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.400
Haoyi...

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:41.359
This...

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.060
This is our very own child...

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:44.260
I'm three months in.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.260
Can you feel it?

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:48.280
Don't spout such nonsense like it's real!

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:49.859
Please, who the hell are you even?

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:51.380
I don't know you, okay?

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:55.120
Jiang Haoyi...

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:57.880
You violate our Goddess and still make such piss-poor excuses?

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:59.680
Have you grown tired of living?

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.160
Looking to die, you bastard?

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:03.880
Mi-milords...

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:05.460
Please let me explain!

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:06.099
Haoyi!

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.960
You don't have to explain.

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:09.460
Our child and I both believe in you! <3

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:09.960
Guh.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:11.799
Goodness, these people...

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.180
Alright, if I stay I die,

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:15.160
Let's find some place where we can talk this through!

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:31.420
Bastard!

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:37.900
Who's calling me names?...

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.760
Hey, go look over there!

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:41.260
Jiang Haoyi, you scum!

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:43.240
We have to get his ass!

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:45.580
Whew, looks like I finally lost them.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.440
They should be off my tail for a bit...

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:55.099
Haoyi...

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:01.480
Our baby said to me just now,

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:03.480
"My legs are short! I can't run very fast."

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.480
You have to be considerate, okay?

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:06.980
Oh come on,

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:08.280
PLEASE stop talking nonsense!

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:09.979
Please, ma'am...

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:11.739
Attention all students.

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.380
We are currently searching for someone.

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:15.280
His name is Jiang Haoyi.

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:18.580
Jiang Haoyi, please report to the dean immediately.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:20.580
Oh man, I'm in big trouble now.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:21.820
Let's split up.

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:23.560
Go wait for me on the roof!

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:24.500
I'll come meet you soon!

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.420
Hey, we found the bitch!

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:28.120
Stop! Give her back!...

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.900
Oh. He's so cool, even when he runs...

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:33.380
:>

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:35.900
Stop!

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:37.640
Stop running!

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.640
Get him! Quick!

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:41.039
Block his path!

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.360
God, these guys are relentless!

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:43.260
Alright then.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.000
Phew. I'm finally done cleaning.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:50.479
Jiang Haoyi!

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:52.480
Just give yourself up already, you bastard!

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:53.160
Yeah!

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:53.720
Stop running!

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:00.299
Piss off!

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:02.740
So... brutal...

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.320
I didn't want to do this.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.159
But you all forced my hand.

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:21.020
Um, uh, ladies?

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:22.680
What do you?...

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:35.740
Jiang Haoyi!

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:37.420
Explain yourself!

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:39.020
What the hell is this?

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:41.420
Mi-Miss Tang Xuan...

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:43.240
I don't really know you...

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:45.420
What are you saying?

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:47.040
You're so mean!

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.440
Do you have any idea how heartbroken I am?

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:52.320
You son of a bitch!

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:55.840
You used to call me your Little XuanXuan when we were together...

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:58.260
And now you're pretending you don't even know me...

00:07:58.960 --> 00:07:59.479
Captain!

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:01.460
Why have you never told us about this before??

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:03.760
You dare to break our Captain's heart...

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:05.940
Do you have a death wish, huh?

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.500
This is between the two of us.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:09.940
Please don't butt in!

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:11.000
Move aside!

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.220
I'll ask you one more time.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.220
Tell me, honestly now...

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:20.340
What's your relationship with that girl, huh?

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:22.159
And if you refuse...

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:23.020
God damn sister,

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:24.080
What the hell is wrong with you?

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.060
I really don't know you!

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:27.340
They're coming out.

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:30.840
Have I been cursed today or something?

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:32.280
Why am I?...

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.039
Haoyi!

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:36.980
Oh, what is it NOW?

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:41.459
Haoyi. Come home with me, okay?

00:08:41.919 --> 00:08:43.799
Hong-chan and Ming-chan both really miss you.

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:47.580
Wait, wait.

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:48.160
Hong-chan?

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:49.020
Ming-chan?

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:50.100
Who the hell are they?

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:52.280
Haoyi, you insufferable!-

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:53.319
Not only have you been having an affiar,

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:55.060
But you've even forgotten both your children!

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:57.600
You unfaithful dog!

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:59.600
How could you do this to the three of us!?

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:04.760
Yo, Ling Yuan.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.760
I'M the only one who can punish MY Haoyi.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.260
Get your ass out of here!

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:10.120
Who said he was yours?

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:11.600
Since the very dawn of this world,

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:12.920
He's been mine, and mine alone!

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:13.740
What did you say?

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:15.459
Okay, this is getting way too scary.

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:17.060
I better bail out of here, and quick.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:20.480
Hey! Jiang Haoyi's running away!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:27.120
Haoyi! Get your ass back here!

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.340
Stop running away!

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:30.340
We have to catch him!

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:35.439
Haoyi!

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:36.540
You've come.~

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:43.859
Haoyi!

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:45.800
Haoyi!

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:50.320
This woman...

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:54.320
Jiang Haoyi!

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.439
You absolutely MUST explain yourself to me!

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:00.380
Yeah, explain yourself!

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:01.260
You hurt our captain!

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:03.140
Talk!

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:05.480
Talk, asshole!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:07.020
Alright, listen up!

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:09.500
I don't know ANY of these three!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.100
If you all keep pushing me,

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:19.060
I'm going to jump!

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:20.099
Die to prove my innocence!

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:20.780
Haoyi! D:

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:26.040
Motherf- Who do you think you're fooling!?

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.900
Quick, grab him!

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:30.280
Liar!

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.140
This accursed day...

00:10:38.140 --> 00:10:39.720
Is finally over...

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.600
But dying so spectacularly...

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.600
Isn't like me at all...

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:57.199
This...

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:58.700
This is...

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.300
Time...

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:09.120
Has stopped.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.800
Huh, looks like you're quite the calm one.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.720
I was expecting you to piss yourself silly on the way down.

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:28.840
God, I don't have time to be messing around with you!

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:29.880
Tell me, tell me, tell me!

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:31.880
Was it you who ate the Cupid's Chocolates??

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:36.660
Cupid's Chocolates?

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:40.340
It wasn't that cake on the roof yesterday, was it?...

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:42.960
Huh? Someone put a cake up here?

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:44.120
What a waste.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:50.060
Eating Cupid's Chocolates will cause you to gain false memories of love.

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.520
And if you eat it together with a girl,

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:55.220
They will start to remember you as...

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:57.180
Their lover...

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:01.980
Wait, then that means... That means they'll bother me like this forever!?

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:04.580
Bingo!

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:07.200
Goddammit!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.600
This can't be true!

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:10.600
Noooooooo!!!
